        "Gräff GmbH is a family-run German manufacturer founded in 1946 and based in Troisdorf. The company develops temperature-measurement products and related thermal-process equipment, producing thousands of temperature-sensor configurations for industrial requirements.",
        "Its official portfolio covers thermocouples and resistance thermometers, melt-pressure sensors, electrical heaters, ISOMA insulating sleeves, process controllers and safety temperature limiters. Gräff supplies standard and application-specific designs for industries including plastics processing, food production, metalworking, furnace construction, automotive manufacturing and mechanical engineering."
