      "shortDescription": "GSR Ventiltechnik develops and manufactures solenoid-operated and pressure-controlled valves for liquids and gases. Its range covers general-purpose, high-pressure, hydrogen, high-temperature and cryogenic valves, together with valve blocks and customer-specific solutions.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "GSR Ventiltechnik GmbH & Co. KG is a German valve manufacturer founded in 1971 and based in Vlotho-Exter. The company develops and produces solenoid-operated and pressure-controlled standard and special valves for liquid and gaseous media.",
        "Its official portfolio includes direct-acting, pilot-operated and force-pilot-operated solenoid valves, pressure-controlled and regulating valves, check and ball valves, strainers, valve blocks, and specialist designs for high-pressure, high-temperature and cryogenic service. GSR remains an active manufacturer identity; its current website identifies it as a subsidiary of Advanced Flow Technologies, while the company profile records its INDUS relationship since 1999."
