      "fullDescription": [
        "Official Güdel contact records distinguish Güdel Group AG, identified as the Swiss headquarters, from Güdel AG, the Swiss operating company; both are listed at the same address in Langenthal. The family-owned Güdel industrial group was founded in 1954.",
        "The documented product range includes rack-and-pinion systems, angle and planetary gearboxes, linear guideways, linear axes and gantries, TrackMotion robot-positioning tracks and application-specific automation solutions. Güdel serves industries including automotive production, rail, intralogistics, machine tools, aerospace, energy, food and tyre manufacturing."
